OL,3,GNEWSACouncil speaker denies making
OL,4,Athreats to kill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe speaker of Bedford Borough Council
OL,7,Fhas denied making threats to kill and
OL,8,Fpossessing an offensive weapon.
OL,10,FTim Caswell was arrested by armed
OL,11,Fofficers after Bedfordshire Police was
OL,12,Fcalled to Crispin Drive shortly before
OL,13,F19:15 BST on Friday over concerns for
OL,14,Fwelfare.
OL,16,FThe 66-year-old, who lives on the
OL,17,Fstreet, pleaded not guilty to the two
OL,18,Fcharges at Luton Magistrates' Court, as
OL,19,Fwell as denying a third charge of
OL,20,Fmaking threats to damage or destroy
OL,21,Fproperty.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
